# Pre-commit: format/fix staged files, then the whole-tree gates. lint-staged
# runs first (format + fix), then the runner executes the pre-commit set from
# scripts/lib/gate-registry.mjs, the one list of gates. The gates verify the
# whole tree, not just staged files, because bilingual checks compare both sides
# of a pair; the registry names the two that run only when their sources are
# staged (the skills mirror and front matter, which a byte-copy mirror would
# carry through unchecked).
npx lint-staged --concurrent 1
node scripts/run-gates.mjs --stage pre-commit
